        <item>
            <title>1.0.11 (2605221711)</title>
            <pubDate>2026-05-22 15:13:32</pubDate>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>15.6</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:version>260522.1711</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>1.0.11</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            
            <description><![CDATA[<p><strong>May 22 - v1.0.11 </strong></p><p></p><p><strong>Features</strong></p><ul><li><p>Shader animation toggle — Added View &gt; Shader Animation to turn the background shader and DJ ripple animations on or off.</p></li><li><p>Click-to-position volume — Single-click anywhere on the volume slider to jump to that volume level. Double-click to toggle mute still works.</p></li><li><p>Option-click to close other windows — Option-click the close button on a player window to close all other player windows while keeping that one open.</p></li><li><p>Dock icon opens a new window — Clicking the dock icon when no windows are open now opens a fresh empty player window.</p><p></p></li></ul><p><strong>Quality of Life</strong></p><ul><li><p>Larger album cover — Maximum album cover size increased from 320px to 600px.</p></li><li><p>Manage License moved to app menu — "Manage License" / "Buy Full Version" moved from the Help menu to the 180db app menu, next to "Check for Updates".</p></li><li><p>Other minor improvements</p></li></ul><p></p><p><strong>Bug Fixes</strong></p><ul><li><p>Fixed window controls when unfocused — The floating close and minimize buttons now work correctly when clicking on a background (non-key) window.</p></li><li><p>Fixed transport not updating when paused — Switching tracks with next/previous while paused no longer shows stale time and duration from the previous track.</p></li><li><p>Fixed volume drag outside window — Dragging the volume slider no longer stops tracking when the cursor leaves the window bounds. The resize cursor also stays visible during the drag.</p></li><li><p>Fixed drag and drop in compact mode — Drag-and-dropping audio files onto the player now works even when the album cover, playlist, and status bar are all hidden.</p></li><li><p>Fixed cover size not restoring after toggle — Toggling the album cover off and on no longer shrinks the window to a smaller size than before.</p></li></ul>]]></description>
            
            <enclosure
                url="https://github.com/Advanced-Research-GmbH/180db-releases/releases/download/v1.0.11%2B260522.1711/180db-1.0.11.dmg"
